# UV-SEAMS: Modeling Mode UVs -> Seams (UE USeamSculptTool; Join as UE's UV Editor seam tool), a session on the selected
# mesh: the existing UV seams drawn green, a path picked vertex to vertex (shortest edge path, Geometry::ShortestEdgePath)
# drawn yellow, Apply cuts or joins the seams on it (Geometry::EditUVSeams), Accept is ONE undo step, Cancel leaves the mesh.
# A 100 cm Box (pivot centre) 60 cm above the origin: every face is its own UV island, so all 12 edges are seams. The
# picks aim 5 cm inside the top face's front corners, so the nearest vertex of the hit triangle is the corner itself and
# the path is the top front edge (-50,110,50) -> (50,110,50).
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,60,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,300,150
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.86,-0.51
Когда run Modeling "UV tool: Seams"
Тогда-вид 0_seams green lines on every visible box edge (top face border and the vertical edges); panel status "6 UV islands"; tool bar UV Seams with Accept and Cancel
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams mode: Join"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.203,-0.857,-0.474
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: pick vertex at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.203,-0.857,-0.474
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: pick vertex at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.86,-0.51
Тогда-вид 1_path a yellow line along the top front edge over the green seam, a dot at each picked corner
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: apply path"
Тогда-вид 2_join the top front edge has no green line any more (the other 11 seams stay); status "Join 1 edges: 1 joined ... 5 UV islands"
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams mode: Cut"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.203,-0.857,-0.474
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: pick vertex at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.203,-0.857,-0.474
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: pick vertex at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "UV Seams: apply path"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.86,-0.51
Тогда-вид 3_cut the green line on the top front edge is back; status "Cut 1 edges: 1 opened ... 6 UV islands"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 4_accepted no tool bar, no seam lines, the box drawn with its material
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда run Modeling "UV tool: Seams"
Тогда-вид 5_undo all 12 edges green again, status "6 UV islands" (the accepted edit was one undo step)
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
